rceGroups</code> resource to create the resource group.</p></li><li><p>A <c=
ode>Microsoft.Resources/deployments</code> resource that deploys the storag=
e account into the newly created group using a nested template.</p></li></u=
l><p>Since the deployment <strong>targets multiple scopes</strong> (subscri=
ption and resource group), you must use a subscription-level deployment cmd=
let like <code>New-AzDeployment</code>.</p><p><br></p><p><code><strong>New-=
AzResourceGroupDeployment</strong></code> is incorrect because it's used to=
