nnot be used when your template includes the creation of a new resource gro=
up.</p><p><br></p><p><code><strong>New-AzSubscriptionDeployment</strong></c=
ode> is an alias for <code>New-AzDeployment</code>, but the preferred cmdle=
t name is <code>New-AzDeployment</code>, which works consistently across al=
l scopes in newer versions of the Az PowerShell module.</p><p><br></p><p><s=
